---
// Pricing2: two wide tiers (Team vs Enterprise) with an "included in every plan" strip underneath.
---

<section class="bg-surface py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl">Two plans. No surprises.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">Pay for the people who plan in Halcyon. Guests, clients and viewers are always free.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-8 shadow-sm sm:p-10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Team</h3>
          <p class="inline-flex rounded-button bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-700 dark:bg-brand-950/40 dark:text-brand-300">14-day free trial</p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">Everything a team of up to fifty needs to plan the week, share timelines and protect focus time.</p>
        <p class="mt-8 flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span class="font-display text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">$12</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-muted">per person / month</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Or $10 per person when billed annually.</p>
        <ul class="mt-8 grid flex-1 gap-3 border-t border-line pt-8 text-sm text-fg sm:grid-cols-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>Unlimited projects</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>Timelines and workload</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>Quiet hours and focus mode</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>40+ integrations</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-button bg-brand-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-brand-700">Start your free trial</a>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-card bg-brand-950 p-8 text-white shadow-xl shadow-brand-950/20 ring-1 ring-white/10 sm:p-10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Enterprise</h3>
          <p class="inline-flex rounded-button bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-100">50+ people</p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-100/80">For larger organisations that need security reviews, custom contracts and a named person to call.</p>
        <p class="mt-8 flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span class="font-display text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Custom</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-brand-100/70">annual agreement</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-100/70">Volume pricing from 50 seats upward.</p>
        <ul class="mt-8 grid flex-1 gap-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 text-sm text-white sm:grid-cols-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>Everything in Team</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>SAML single sign-on and SCIM</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>Audit log and data residency</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>Dedicated success manager</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact" class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-button bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-950 transition hover:bg-brand-100">Talk to sales</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-8 sm:p-10">
      <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Included in every plan</h3>
      <ul class="mt-8 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <li class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-button bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 dark:bg-brand-950/40 dark:text-brand-300">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5" />
              <path d="M2.5 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 13 0" />
              <path d="M16 4.6a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 6.8" />
              <path d="M18.5 14.2A6.5 6.5 0 0 1 21.5 20" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Unlimited free guests</p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Invite clients and contractors to view and comment at no cost.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-button bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 dark:bg-brand-950/40 dark:text-brand-300">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="7" y="2.5" width="10" height="19" rx="2.5" />
              <path d="M11 18h2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Mobile and desktop apps</p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Native apps for iOS, Android, Mac and Windows that work offline.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-button bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 dark:bg-brand-950/40 dark:text-brand-300">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 3l7.5 3v5.5c0 4.5-3 8-7.5 9.5-4.5-1.5-7.5-5-7.5-9.5V6z" />
              <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Encryption and daily backups</p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Your plans are encrypted in transit and at rest, and backed up every night.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-button bg-brand-50 text-brand-600 dark:bg-brand-950/40 dark:text-brand-300">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z" />
              <path d="M8 9h8" />
              <path d="M8 12h5" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Support from real people</p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Email the team that builds Halcyon and hear back within one working day.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
